WEBVTT

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.680
You did good, Chiko.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:21.060
There's the airship!

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.020
They took the Clock of the Three Magi!

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.050
It's cold!

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.770
Of course it is!

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:51.060
Huh?  Odd time of the year to be snowing.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.940
The train's here.  Let's go.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.470
Yessir.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.660
Is everyone here?

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.450
Coming, Chiko?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:20.170
They're probably all chasing after the airship by now.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.680
Too bad they don't know it's a decoy.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.050
Those poor idiots.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:54.840
Imagine the look on their faces when they see it's a fake.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.550
Let's be friends!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.880
My father's in charge of security.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.570
My dad would lose his job.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:09.060
Angie...

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:13.790
We can celebrate a job well done once we board the train.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.440
You were the star today, Chiko.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.150
You really worked hard this time, Chiko.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.150
Fräulein,

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.410
after you.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.090
Chiko,

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.620
what's wrong?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.600
Are you not feeling well?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.670
It's nothing.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.830
You must be tired.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.920
That's what happens after a big job like that.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:45.250
It was my screw up that got her into that mess.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.140
I'm going to get the boss.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.200
Hey!  Chiko!

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.170
Leave her be.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.340
But she's acting weird...

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:58.340
She just wants to be alone.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.560
Thank you very much.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:12.440
Now the Clock of the Three Magi will be in safe hands.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.120
It's been hidden in the spot we decided on.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.540
Have no worries.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:23.920
The town council voted to sell off the Clock of the Three Magi at the conclusion of the public showing.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:30.100
Though the town is facing economic difficulties, I couldn't bring myself to sell such a precious treasure.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.600
I may lose my job as mayor.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:37.820
The Clock of the Three Magi belonged to the three wise men from the Bible.

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:41.210
It was the device they used to calculate the birth of the Messiah.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.690
You know quite a bit about it.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.760
It's the occult.  I've been involved with similar things in the past.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:53.220
In the last days of the great war, the soldiers prayed in earnest.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.680
Were you privy to national secrets?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.190
Oh, my apologies.  That's asking too much.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.680
Here's the information I promised you.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:07.420
I have no idea what possible use you'll have for it though.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:22.810
I lost hope in the world during the course of the war.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.700
And now, even though the fighting is over,

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.200
there are still evil people squirming in the dark.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:34.080
My goal is to rewrite the whole panorama of this world to suit my wishes.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:38.600
In order to do that, I need to fashion another person like myself.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.410
Another person?

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.040
I wish that was me.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.660
Now we can finally say goodbye to circus life.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.590
What a relief!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.900
But it suited you so well, Skipper.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:09.990
Sure did!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:14.580
Still, we won't get to see Chiko walk the tightrope anymore.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.540
That was something else!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:20.500
Oh yeah, she hasn't gotten back yet, has she?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.260
I wonder if she's all right.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.250
She seemed sort of down.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.210
I'll go check on her.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.160
Hey!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.850
Wait!  I'm getting on!

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:38.200
Chiko.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:40.210
Yasu-san.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:43.410
What's wrong?  Everyone's worried about you.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.630
I'm sorry.

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:45.830
Let's go.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:46.590
OK.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:59.940
Yasu-san?!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.770
Angie?

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:13.630
Oh, it's her – Twenty Faces's daughter.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.790
Guys!  Run!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.010
Hey, Tiger.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.840
Let me handle her.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.190
Fine with me.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.830
You got close to me to learn about our movements, didn't you?

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:09.590
You were a fool for not realizing it.

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:13.960
Don't think you're a big deal just because they call you the "Daughter of Twenty Faces" or whatever!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.830
I can't stomach that innocent look of yours.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:22.120
I'll show you that I'm better than you!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.450
My, look at you!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:46.970
They're all...

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.500
They're all in danger.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.030
It's Tiger!

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:22.680
Hide-nii!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.750
Hans!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.690
What's that?

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:45.760
What's going on?

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:51.270
Don't worry, you can see them in the next world.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:54.350
As for you, you're my opponent!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.040
The circus is over.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.590
You're a feisty one.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.670
You're not getting away.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.690
Where's Chiko?  Is she with the boss?

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:50.770
I have to...

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.100
...get to them quickly.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:43.670
Skipper!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.680
Take care of the boss and Chiko, Ken.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.020
Let go of me!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.310
What boring companions to die with.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.160
Don't!  Skipper!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.530
Skipper!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.920
My shoe...

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:24.670
Too bad!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.300
Just watch quietly as your buddies get slaughtered.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.510
You're going to die in agony and there's nothing you can do about it.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.760
Wait right there.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.140
I'm coming over there now to strike the final blow.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.330
Damn!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.530
She's tough.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.070
The shooting's... stopped.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:19.870
Goro-san.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.200
Tetsu-san.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:24.890
Hide-san.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:27.530
Kai-san.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.960
Hans-san.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.970
The gunfire... has ended.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:42.520
That means they probably finished killing each other.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.830
Not bad.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:49.670
The one who laid waste to Twenty Faces's organization...

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.110
...was me!

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:56.410
The mayor of Toran chartered this train,

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.150
but you guys were the only ones boarding it.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.490
That's how I figured it out.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:04.810
What were you trying to do?

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:07.100
You're not a regular thief.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:10.550
You're plotting something much bigger, aren't you?

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:14.300
Like maybe trying to take over the world.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.870
How about it, Twenty Faces-kun?

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.040
Will you join forces with me?

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.710
Muta-san?!

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.800
Hang in there, Muta-san!

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.780
I'm sorry.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.210
Don't talk.

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:58.710
The others?

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.180
I... see.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.370
Muta-san...

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.200
Chiko.

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:31.730
Muta-san!

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.160
You have to...

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:36.150
...escape.

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:37.840
Muta-san!

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.590
It was fun while it lasted.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.230
No...

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.680
Muta-san...

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:50.650
Muta-san!

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.200
Well?

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:00.660
Will you join me?

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.650
I decline.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:15.090
I've seen countless men like you.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:20.090
I have no desire to join hands with a scoundrel consumed by greed such as you.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.180
Mister?

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.530
Where are you, Mister?

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.000
Is that you, Chiko?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.700
Mister?

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:52.810
Mister!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.040
Are you unharmed?

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:01.010
Mister!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.410
They're all...

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.890
They're all...!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.370
I'm not dying alone.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:34.960
Mister...

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.120
Mister!
